<title>USA: NYSE UNAVAILABLES -.</title>
<headline>NYSE UNAVAILABLES -.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Monday that Buenos Aires Embotelladora SA and Huntingdon Life were unavailable.</p>
<p>The exchange said Ultrasonic Industrial Sciences Ltd and Hudson Foods Inc were unavailable for news.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
